&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;bqmsiu&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;30&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Client Services Associate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;31&quot; data-end=&quot;206&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; has an immediate opening for a &lt;strong&gt;Client Services Associate&lt;/strong&gt; in our &lt;strong&gt;Newtown Square, PA &lt;/strong&gt;office. This position is &lt;strong&gt;on site Monday-Friday 8:30am-5pm&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;208&quot; data-end=&quot;619&quot;&gt;Are you looking for an exciting opportunity in a fast-growing industry where you can make a meaningful impact while building your career? At &lt;span class=&quot;hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, we believe our clients and their families deserve care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability. We are seeking motivated, career-driven professionals who are eager to grow within a dynamic and supportive environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;621&quot; data-end=&quot;942&quot;&gt;Through hands-on experience and mentorship, Client Services Associates gain valuable exposure to all aspects of office operations, client services, scheduling, staffing, and team management — preparing them for future growth opportunities within the organization, including advancement into Client Services Manager roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;103byja&quot; data-start=&quot;944&quot; data-end=&quot;965&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;966&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xdxnhf&quot; data-start=&quot;966&quot; data-end=&quot;1039&quot;&gt;Coordinate and assist with managing client services, scheduling, and staffing needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5d8iaj&quot; data-start=&quot;1040&quot; data-end=&quot;1109&quot;&gt;Support field staff in delivering high-quality home health services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c66yv2&quot; data-start=&quot;1222&quot; data-end=&quot;1326&quot;&gt;Assist with various administrative tasks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1whzy7x&quot; data-start=&quot;1465&quot; data-end=&quot;1534&quot;&gt;Foster positive communication and engagement with field employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dqfu1e&quot; data-start=&quot;1535&quot; data-end=&quot;1593&quot;&gt;Support employee recognition and retention initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d2soum&quot; data-start=&quot;1594&quot; data-end=&quot;1667&quot;&gt;Maintain accurate documentation and data entry within company systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;1obkcim&quot; data-start=&quot;1669&quot; data-end=&quot;1688&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1689&quot; data-end=&quot;2180&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1nl50vj&quot; data-start=&quot;1689&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16pbifa&quot; data-start=&quot;1770&quot; data-end=&quot;1810&quot;&gt;Customer service experience required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ggs5o8&quot; data-start=&quot;1811&quot; data-end=&quot;1877&quot;&gt;Strong interpersonal, organizational, and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;z0sd27&quot; data-start=&quot;1878&quot; data-end=&quot;1956&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to achieve goals and build professional relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1v7gk19&quot; data-start=&quot;1957&quot; data-end=&quot;2028&quot;&gt;Ambition to grow professionally and advance within the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;j0zt3l&quot; data-start=&quot;2029&quot; data-end=&quot;2104&quot;&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Office and strong computer/data entry skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kf4jg5&quot; data-start=&quot;2105&quot; data-end=&quot;2180&quot;&gt;Comfortable with phone communication and relationship-building outreach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
